OL,3,AKeir Starmer announces he is standing
OL,4,Adown as MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Prime Pinister Sir Keir Starmer
OL,7,Fhas announced he is to stand down as an
OL,8,FMP to focus on a role in international
OL,9,Faffairs.
OL,11,FThe move will trigger a by-election in
OL,12,Fthe London seat of Holborn and St
OL,13,FPancras, long a Labour stronghold,
OL,14,Fwhich he has represented since 2015.
OL,16,FSir Keir, who left Downing Street in
OL,17,FJuly, had previously said he would stay
OL,18,Fon as an MP until the next UK general
OL,19,Felection, which is not due until 2029.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
